<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηρεφής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overhanging, beetling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηρεφέας φύγε πέτρας νηῦς ἐμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.131
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				12.59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρημνοὶ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.54
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.208
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>covered, sheltered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίμβλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					598
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φολίδεσσι,</span> of a dragon,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.144
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέος πέτρῃσιν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.736
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήσους ἐ. δονάκεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simm.
					1.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυμβοι ἐ. πετάλοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					74.24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				8.14
			</span></i>.</div>
